{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>呂良偉與太太楊小娟結婚多年恩愛如昔，兩公婆經常出雙入對，羨煞旁人。去年呂良偉開Party慶祝大壽，廣邀圈中好友出席，當時他更向愛妻公開告白：「我更要感恩嘅就係我太太楊小娟，一個仙女下凡到我呂家，小娟係我生命裏邊，非常非常重要嘅一個寶藏。」貴為富婆的楊小娟，一向打扮貴氣，不時坐遊艇出海，又搭私人飛機出遊，相當富貴！</p><figure><img alt=\"兩公婆經常出雙入對，羨煞旁人。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260501/1126948157654437888642075.jpeg/3i9nxA2o-ED8h5HgrgPEsWpROfRbBKoMHyQafx8kGn8\"/><figcaption>兩公婆經常出雙入對，羨煞旁人。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"享受奢華之旅！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250710/1020036104838975488369082.jpeg/mPZNlc_lyW4N-fS-MrdIlMHrIIPsZtDWx2EXbcdhF20\"/><figcaption>享受奢華之旅！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"享受奢華之旅！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250710/1020036110459604992267354.jpeg/xEB749aaW3jSyufYfN0ms1bh8M8XwFw2HZyl6R2cpek\"/><figcaption>享受奢華之旅！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"坐遊艇出海。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250710/1020036115736301568295046.jpeg/w0YiFZr8uCOfuw-Aql39A_mSoaXDjoe0agjlDmoI5Q4\"/><figcaption>坐遊艇出海。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好歎呀！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250710/1020036090234408960723468.jpeg/vEHJo-pQv2GcNq6EeXebwJiXcGoNte7r_E-_AfxPvwE\"/><figcaption>好歎呀！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊小娟同范冰冰私交甚篤。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260501/1126948152281272320091672.jpeg/WOF298zEwerAVEuGVDsJaEcEY_I2aWAuWoJpYVqCaWE\"/><figcaption>楊小娟同范冰冰私交甚篤。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊小娟同范冰冰私交甚篤。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260501/1126948149798113280526701.jpeg/82Nffqe80Ru4Pyci8-STTvC55HVEROD0UHutQVB7rUE\"/><figcaption>楊小娟同范冰冰私交甚篤。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"同黎姿。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199414138992857088351496.jpeg/YsdOUMBkVa-sYxUO4GnJuV5pS1Z8rAt1Y91d1WPdXdU\"/><figcaption>同黎姿。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>楊小娟私人飛機奢華行頭曝光　戴巨型翡翠頸鍊</p><p>楊小娟在社交平台分享靚相，相中所見，楊小娟身處私人飛機內，她佩戴了一條極具特色的翡翠頸鍊，吊墜由三個垂直的綠色翡翠管狀零件組成，下方連接一粒巨型翡翠，分量十足，再以紅寶石及鑽石點綴，相信價值不菲！</p><figure><img alt=\"楊小娟身處私人飛機內。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260501/1126947486288711680298631.jpeg/e3WimJ6qsK-xpXsf4FnnApPOk07B_ErT4KEKxeChCsU\"/><figcaption>楊小娟身處私人飛機內。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"價值不菲！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260501/1126947483654557696138649.jpeg/sjYvc2OjaCQJRpfIzLlDg_073BFIDbqSN2f3Zzdn92c\"/><figcaption>價值不菲！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"搭私人飛機去倫敦。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250710/1020035702312144896251743.jpeg/5Pv9FTLXwEyP55X1ezh2jjw_zbTPZo64J74W-ye-Fvs\"/><figcaption>搭私人飛機去倫敦。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"搭私人飛機去倫敦。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250710/1020035682615169024470152.jpeg/FpIrEfZYtMaIwt6AcFtRiNWrjq3G_-Msfzr0m3869Js\"/><figcaption>搭私人飛機去倫敦。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"呂良偉坐在窗邊欣賞風景。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250710/1020035699707351040357642.jpeg/QeQVY4C-eo6dLObAtNublt3uA_e-H8vKQoKxUkKCsVI\"/><figcaption>呂良偉坐在窗邊欣賞風景。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貴氣十足！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250710/1020035698809901056347591.jpeg/nn-Ks1D49SKFW77fuVXh8_KYSZmgI260ubkB7rm5Ae4\"/><figcaption>貴氣十足！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊小娟擁有的限量版Hermès Ghillies Birkin手袋是鴕鳥皮、鱷魚皮及蜥蜴皮三拼款式，十分罕有，估計約40萬港元。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250710/1020035690332688384704196.jpeg/Ns2N29NCKXjQnbIb4GOUZGjlXAKjvpHhWBG0E1gRtBM\"/><figcaption>楊小娟擁有的限量版Hermès Ghillies Birkin手袋是鴕鳥皮、鱷魚皮及蜥蜴皮三拼款式，十分罕有，估計約40萬港元。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>呂良偉曾陷負資產靠妻翻身　楊小娟精準理財傳坐擁數十億身家</p><p>在內地經商多年的楊小娟在政商界都人脈甚廣，有傳當年因為投資房地產搞到負資產的呂良偉，全靠太太支持才成功翻身，縱橫商海多年的楊小娟為老公提供了很多投資意見，而呂良偉亦曾大讚老婆投資眼光獨到從無失手，外界估計他的身家已達數十億！而呂良偉同老婆楊小娟平日的衣着打扮亦十分貴氣，經常成身名牌，行頭十足！</p><figure><img alt=\"行頭十足！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260501/1126948154860900352597041.jpeg/ghi-tg9tRL7E4xn_vX9KMuU_TI5lRP_3H_UUXx_1FF8\"/><figcaption>行頭十足！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"呂良偉同老婆楊小娟平日的衣着打扮十分貴氣。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250710/1020037405329461248067925.jpeg/kww4EA_BOHivmN_SWahy7mrrUbegVr1bg5p8XYOafF0\"/><figcaption>呂良偉同老婆楊小娟平日的衣着打扮十分貴氣。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貴氣十足！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250710/1020037402615615488037421.jpeg/UNthBX5CwfdbwJYslxjU-4GRLwUgSuM1SoG0AkqBtAI\"/><figcaption>貴氣十足！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊小娟有不少Hermès手袋。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250710/1020037397741572096032648.jpeg/IbTRz8uDKbkd9yBoXZnhRN0n0eTT-YOaOnigLTp4oC0\"/><figcaption>楊小娟有不少Hermès手袋。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊小娟有不少Hermès手袋。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250710/1020036696672178176204597.jpeg/NvLp8HZhM_uaZMSo2k9fY90HEzigNgNC97zXEPe81xA\"/><figcaption>楊小娟有不少Hermès手袋。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊小娟有不少Hermès手袋。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250710/1020036699092422656315426.jpeg/caaOaGQKCsrzvvY_lscagxrKam5eERDQmaEmB5mhJgc\"/><figcaption>楊小娟有不少Hermès手袋。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"富婆！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250710/1020037400228925440143857.jpeg/Lz831m4zeGOaufieqpLG1ySvkLbaDwy3oUIYiKFCGIg\"/><figcaption>富婆！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"富婆！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230504/730864125361524736063182.jpeg/iv7LlRQJPfEVrhywogU6PA3DIu0q7-dGsQLoKrEC6Co\"/><figcaption>富婆！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T01:23:20.074702+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":880,"images":23,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T01:00:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T03:52:43.002404+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T01:16:48.710618+00:00","content_hash":"473862b45b96e83b65fc7cb559536caec87417d98e267c00df98cb9f42ddacd2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}